
class Solution {
    public int findDuplicate(int[] nums) {
        Arrays.sort(nums);

        for(int i=0; i<nums.length - 1; i++){
            if(nums[i] == nums[i+1]){
                return nums[i];
            }
        }

        return -1;
    }
}
Time Complexity

Arrays.sort(nums) → O(n log n)

Loop to check adjacent elements → O(n)

